	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hirose FH12-10S-0.5SH(55) - 10-way 0.5 mm pitch FPC/FFC receptacle, bottom contact, ZIF flip lock. Land pattern derived from the in-house FH12-20S-0.5SH(55) footprint: 10 contacts removed, every other feature moved 2.5 mm inward per side. Verified against the FH12 series datasheet (Hirose, Digi-Key mirror FH12_Series.pdf, read 2026-09-02): contact span A = 0.5*(n-1) = 4.5 mm and body width B = A+3.6 = 8.1 mm both scale exactly -5.0 mm from the 20-way, so every feature keeps a constant offset from the contact array. Pin 1 marked by the silk arc at x=-2.75.")
